        ["微軟接受咗登入，但係個郵箱未俾 IMAP 連線。去 outlook.live.com → 設定 → 郵件 → 轉寄和 IMAP，開啟 IMAP 再儲存；如果仲唔得，去 account.live.com/activity 喺最新嗰次登入撳「這是我」，等幾分鐘再試。"] = new[] { "微軟已接受登入，但此郵箱尚未允許 IMAP 連線。請到 outlook.live.com → 設定 → 郵件 → 轉寄和 IMAP，開啟 IMAP 並儲存；如仍不行，請到 account.live.com/activity 在最新一次登入按「這是我」，等幾分鐘再試。", "微软已接受登录，但此邮箱尚未允许 IMAP 连接。请到 outlook.live.com → 设置 → 邮件 → 转寄和 IMAP，打开 IMAP 并保存；如仍不行，请到 account.live.com/activity 在最新一次登录按“这是我”，等几分钟再试。", "Microsoft accepted the sign-in, but this mailbox does not allow IMAP yet. Go to outlook.live.com → Settings → Mail → Forwarding and IMAP, turn on IMAP and save. If it still fails, open account.live.com/activity, mark the latest sign-in as \"This was me\", then wait a few minutes and try again." },
        ["微軟話短時間內登入太多次，請等幾分鐘再試。"] = new[] { "微軟表示短時間內登入次數太多，請等幾分鐘再試。", "微软表示短时间内登录次数太多，请等几分钟再试。", "Microsoft says there were too many sign-ins in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again." },
        ["Azure App 未開「允許公用用戶端流程」：去 Authentication (Preview) 開咗佢再試。"] = new[] { "Azure App 未開啟「允許公用用戶端流程」：請到 Authentication (Preview) 開啟後再試。", "Azure App 未打开“允许公用用户端流程”：请到 Authentication (Preview) 打开后再试。", "The Azure app does not allow public client flows: turn it on under Authentication (Preview) and try again." },
        ["返去信件清單（Esc）"] = new[] { "返回郵件列表（Esc）", "返回邮件列表（Esc）", "Back to the mail list (Esc)" },
        ["公司 / 學校帳戶（Microsoft 365）；Hotmail / Outlook.com 個人帳戶唔好剔"] = new[] { "公司／學校帳戶（Microsoft 365）；Hotmail／Outlook.com 個人帳戶請勿勾選", "公司／学校帐户（Microsoft 365）；Hotmail／Outlook.com 个人帐户请勿勾选", "Work / school account (Microsoft 365). Leave unticked for personal Hotmail / Outlook.com" },
